<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Examination Management & Logistics</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-standard operational engine that secures the integrity and smooth execution 
            of both internal assessments and external national examinations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Strategic Scheduling & Planning</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate the logistical friction of exam season. The Examinations module allows for 
            the creation of complex internal examination schedules, coordinating venues, 
            subjects, and student cohorts across the school. Automated seating plan 
            generation ensures that students are distributed optimally across exam 
            halls, protecting the integrity of the assessment while maximizing 
            facility utilization.
        </p>
        <p>
            The system also facilitates the generation of 'Form 1' and other ZIMSEC-required 
            enrollment lists for external candidates, ensuring that your institutional 
            registration records are perfectly formatted for national submission.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Staff Load & Invigilation Governance</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain organizational fairness with automated invigilator assignment. Frame 
            distributes invigilation duties across academic staff while balancing 
            teaching workloads and observing departmental boundaries. Staff receive 
            immediate notifications of their assignments—via the portal and 
            WhatsApp—and the system maintains a complete log of duty fulfillment 
            and any irregularities reported durante the exam window.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Post-Exam Results Consolidation</h2>
        <p>
            Once assessments are concluded, the Examinations module coordinates the high-speed 
            upload of marks from departmental mark-books. Validation checks ensure that 
            entered results are within valid numeric ranges and align with the 
            student's subject registration, before migrating data into the central 
            academic database for term-end computation.
        </p>
        <p>
            This closed-loop system—from scheduling to final mark capture—ensures that 
            the school's academic cycle remains efficient and resilient against 
            administrative bottlenecks.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

